  "confounder_quality": 0.45,
  "rationale": "The treatment (business_model_category) is genuinely intervenable and matches the query's proposed shift, satisfying part (a). However, most added columns (remote_delivery_capability, localization_dependency, customer_engagement_model) are mediators/components of the treatment shift rather than confounders, since they lie on the causal path from a business-model change to regional fit. Only physical_infrastructure_intensity and current_geographic_presence plausibly act as common causes of both the current business model and regional fit, and while both are unnamed in the query, they are structural traits that arguably determine the model as much as cause it, making their confounder status moderate. The set under-delivers on the decisive test: it provides few clean, non-named confounders to adjust for before reading off the counterfactual effect."
